@startuml LeafNode_DFD_Level0
title CoPaila - Level 0 Data Flow Diagram (Context Diagram)

!define ENTITYCOLOUR #FFD8B3
!define PROCESSCOLOUR #B3D9FF
!define DATACOLOUR #D9FFB3

entity "School Admin\n(User)" as school_admin <<ENTITYCOLOUR>>
entity "Student/Teacher\n(User)" as student <<ENTITYCOLOUR>>
entity "System Admin\n(Super User)" as admin <<ENTITYCOLOUR>>

rectangle "CoPaila Carbon Audit Platform" as system <<PROCESSCOLOUR>> {
}

database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as db <<DATACOLOUR>>
entity "OMRChecker\nService" as omr <<ENTITYCOLOUR>>
entity "External\nData Sources" as external <<ENTITYCOLOUR>>

' Data flows from external entities
school_admin --> system: School Registration, Audit Data, OMR Sheets
student --> system: Login, View Dashboards, Complete Tasks, View Results
admin --> system: Manage Users, Approve Schools, Monitor System
system --> school_admin: Reports, Recommendations, Audit Results
system --> student: Dashboard, Progress, Achievements, Leaderboard
system --> admin: System Status, Analytics, Audit Logs

' Database interaction
system <--> db: Read/Write School Data, User Data, Audit Records, Activity Data
system <--> omr: Send OMR Image, Receive Scanned Data
external --> system: Emission Factors, Weather Data, Regional Statistics

' OMR interaction
school_admin --> omr: OMR Sheet Images (via Platform)
omr --> system: Scanned OMR Data (CSV/JSON)

note right of system
CoPaila System handles:
- User Authentication & Authorization
- School Registration & Management
- Carbon Audit Data Collection
- OMR Sheet Processing
- Carbon Emissions Calculation
- Report Generation
- Gamification & Achievements
end note

@enduml
